---
# The headers under this directory are the standalone ser library, imported verbatim so
# that the two copies stay mergeable. Reformatting them to the duckling style would turn
# every future import into a conflict, and their own style is internally consistent.
#
# Duckling-side code (tests/, CMakeLists.txt) is outside this directory and is formatted
# normally. src/ser/ser.cpp is the one exception and is hand-kept in duckling style.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
DisableFormat: true
SortIncludes: Never
...
